## Oversized tool results

The largest tool results in the window. Identical calls (same tool, scope, and size) are grouped — *Calls* shows how many times that exact payload was pulled into context, so the true context cost of a row is Bytes × Calls. Payloads this size usually indicate an unscoped read or shell dump. Externally-determined results (`Agent`, `WebSearch`, `WebFetch`) and image/binary reads are excluded at the query level, so every row here is tunable.

| Tool | Scope | Bytes | Calls |
|---|---|---:|---:|
